---
import Section from "./Section.astro";
import { profile } from "../data/site";
---

<Section id="about" eyebrow="About" title="A bit about me">
  <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-3">
    <div class="md:col-span-2">
      <p class="text-[var(--fg-muted)] leading-relaxed">
        {profile.summary} Over the past 4+ years, I’ve worked across the stack, designing backend systems, database architectures, RESTful APIs, event-driven integrations, and the internal tools that help teams move faster. I enjoy taking ownership of systems from initial design through deployment and ongoing improvement, with a strong focus on maintainability, reliability, and clear architecture. I also value developer experience and actively contribute to the open-source tools and libraries I rely on in my day-to-day work.
      </p>
    </div>
    <dl class="flex flex-col gap-3 text-sm">
      <div class="flex justify-between border-b border-[var(--border)] pb-3">
        <dt class="text-[var(--fg-muted)]">Location</dt>
        <dd>{profile.location}</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="flex justify-between border-b border-[var(--border)] pb-3">
        <dt class="text-[var(--fg-muted)]">Experience</dt>
        <dd>4+ years</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="flex justify-between pb-3">
        <dt class="text-[var(--fg-muted)]">Email</dt>
        <dd class="truncate"><a href={`mailto:${profile.email}`} class="hover:underline">{profile.email}</a></dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</Section>
